SITE2="From 2019 to 2020 I worked on site in the Philippines. As a field engineer on residential subdivision finishing works I assisted with site inspections and quality checks, tracked procurement and materials, prepared site, material and progress reports, and coordinated with engineers, subcontractors and suppliers. Before that, as project-in-charge on a community hall renovation, I coordinated 10 to 15 workers each day and reviewed structural and architectural drawings against project requirements."
DIP2="In February 2026 I finished an Advanced Diploma of Civil Construction Design at Albright Institute in Australia, covering earthworks, road geometry, pavement design and stormwater drainage, with drawings in AutoCAD and Civil 3D and cost estimates and bills of quantities. I also hold a Bachelor of Science in Civil Engineering from the Philippines (2019)."
